.e2e/artifacts/
# Committing cache entries is opt-in: `e2e init` ignores `.e2e/cache/` and a
# project removes that line to share replays. The testbed's caches come from
# throwaway fixture apps and a live production site, so no entry is worth
# committing here.
.e2e/cache/
.e2e/sessions/
.e2e/report.json
.e2e/ai-trace.json
bench/.next/
# AI SDK devtools trace database written by testbed telemetry.
.devtools/
tmp-host-demo/
.e2e/appstore/
